  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "覆盖前过滤器",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[hook]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，这类材料与隐蔽验收题 不是让你背检验批、分项、分部那套层级程序。它考的是覆盖前过滤器：材料缺陷要在使用前拦住，隐蔽缺陷要在盖板合上前看见。你看白板上，覆盖板一合，里面的基层、保温层、热桥处理就看不见了；只有合格证的材料托盘，也不能直接冲进现场。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 23.232,
      "requestId": "c624f807-835d-901d-bcce-a6328214cbc4",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "material_gate",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "有合格证不等于复验合格",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[material_gate]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第一道材料闸，先查质量证明、数量、规格和外观，还要做标识和台账。可是合格证只是一张进场凭证，不等于复验已经合格。涉及安全、节能、环保的主要材料，还要按要求复验，经认可合格后才能使用。这里的画面动作很重要：证书点亮的是第一盏灯，样品还要被抽出去复验。",
      "startSec": 23.632,
      "durSec": 24.264,
      "requestId": "e3a9a9d3-b1a2-9310-ac10-e431540a50b8",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "retest_list",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "按材料对象列复验格",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[retest_list]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第二道复验闸，按材料对象列格子。普通钢筋要写屈服强度、抗拉强度、伸长率、弯曲性能、重量偏差五项。水泥又是胶砂强度、氯离子、安定性、凝结时间。保温材料要看导热系数、密度、燃烧性能等题面对象。注意成型钢筋的弯曲格会灰掉，它进场可不检弯曲性能。",
      "startSec": 48.296,
      "durSec": 24.144,
      "requestId": "077855fe-a214-9f1d-a42f-f39da19dd996",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "witness_chain",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "见证链看主体、时机、记录",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[witness_chain]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第三道见证链，看三个动作。试样应在施工现场内抽取，送检前通知见证人；见证人由建设单位书面确认；见证记录由见证人填写，检测机构还要核实见证人。把见证人写成监理确认，或者把记录写成试验员填，画面上都会被弹开，因为主体一错，见证链就断了。",
      "startSec": 72.84,
      "durSec": 22.464,
      "requestId": "0c01c8f4-3489-9a6b-92a5-2b6acc949e93",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hidden_shutter",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "隐蔽先验收记录，再覆盖",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[hidden_shutter]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第四道隐蔽闸，只有覆盖前有效。节能隐蔽不是一句资料归档，要看基层及表面处理、保温材料种类和厚度、热桥处理、隔汽层这些部位。白板上的快门先拍下隐检记录，覆盖板才合上。如果先盖住再补记录，那就不是验收窗口里的现场验收了。",
      "startSec": 95.704,
      "durSec": 21.672,
      "requestId": "c1648701-a67f-98ae-b5cf-5cb697813a3c",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "branch_trap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "找错沿三条支路淘汰",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[branch_trap]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第五步把常见错支路一次淘汰。第一条，有合格证就直接用，错在把凭证当复验。第二条，施工单位自取自送，送检后才通知，错在见证链断。第三条，隐蔽部位已经覆盖后补记录，错在时机已经晚了。案例题要逐项写不妥，再逐项补正确动作。",
      "startSec": 117.776,
      "durSec": 21.864,
      "requestId": "37fc8b61-f008-9d6f-a11b-b5bc9d926f7c",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "定环节、列复验、写见证、覆盖前验收",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[score]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后写到答题纸。第一句，先按题面定环节。第二句，材料进场应核查质量证明和外观等，需要复验的材料要见证取样送检，经认可合格后使用。第三句，试样现场内抽取，送检前通知见证人，见证记录由见证人填写并由检测机构核验。第四句，隐蔽部位覆盖前验收并形成记录，合格后再覆盖。",
      "startSec": 140.04,
      "durSec": 26.808,
      "requestId": "0bfe402b-568d-9d28-b9fd-e36c20c17c12",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，那材料有合格证，我再写外观看过了，这块能拿分不？",
      "startSec": 167.248,
      "durSec": 6.048,
      "requestId": "63d9af5b-5ec1-9fd9-8800-d154b1a803e0",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[cert_equals_ok]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "能拿到一点进场凭证意识，但不够。这类材料与隐蔽验收题 要把“有证”和“复验合格”分开，涉及安全、节能、环保的材料还要按要求见证取样复验，经认可后才能使用。",
      "startSec": 173.696,
      "durSec": 13.632,
      "requestId": "001a8527-98d5-929b-9e4f-013725c93ea6",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "这块我老整混，见证人是不是监理确认，记录让试验员填也行不？",
      "startSec": 187.728,
      "durSec": 7.128,
      "requestId": "ab6e0cbf-d07a-9258-8e7a-4bd415538ea6",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[witness_supervisor]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不行。按这张源卡的训练口径，见证人由建设单位书面确认，见证记录由见证人填写。你写成监理确认或试验员记录，主体就错了，见证链会断。",
      "startSec": 195.256,
      "durSec": 12.48,
      "requestId": "f9fd82c0-53a8-9e26-aac2-8e03aba56804",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那隐蔽部位已经盖上了，我让他们补张隐检记录，这么改行不？",
      "startSec": 208.136,
      "durSec": 5.304,
      "requestId": "14709adf-ae24-9fa6-9d93-954116238967",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[hidden_after_cover]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不能这么写。隐蔽验收的关键就是覆盖前，看得见、够得着、能检查。覆盖后补记录，只是在补资料，不是把现场隐蔽验收补回来了。",
      "startSec": 213.84,
      "durSec": 11.904,
      "requestId": "ed284e94-e86c-91f7-ba04-a3f75690c91c",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "facts[memory_hook]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记住哈，这类材料与隐蔽验收题 就一句话：材料先过门，样品带见证，隐蔽先拍再盖。现在进闯关，别背空话，按材料样品、见证章、隐蔽剖面这三个对象写采分句。",
      "startSec": 226.144,
      "durSec": 14.208,
      "requestId": "0d5e286b-6a7e-9ff7-abf5-ac85b1a97e98",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}
